{
    "title": "Gotham Sports",
    "description": "Gotham Sports is the new streaming home for the New York Yankees, the New York Knicks, the Brooklyn Nets, the New York Rangers, the New York Islanders, the New Jersey Devils, the Buffalo Sabres, and more all in one, easy-to-use app. Access to Gotham Sports includes:\r\no Live games and full game replays\r\no Hometown coverage and in-depth analysis\r\no Award-winning original programming and exclusive content\r\no Play-by-play stats and Pick-N-Play predictor game with prizes\r\no Gotham Sports rewards program \r\n\r\nThere are two ways fans can get access to Gotham Sports: \r\n1. Free with an eligible cable subscription:  \r\nif you have access YES Networks and MSG Networks as part of your cable subscription, you\u2019ll have free access to Gotham Sports. Just download the app, create a free account, and link your cable subscription account. \r\n2. Subscribe directly to Gotham Sports:  \r\nif you don\u2019t have access to an eligible TV subscription, you can subscribe directly in the Gotham Sports app or on https://gothamsports.com/. \r\n\r\nLocation restrictions:\r\no Gotham Sports will only stream games that are available on the YES Networks and MSG Network. Local blackout restrictions apply.\r\no League and programming restrictions require Gotham Sports mobile & tablet users to turn on location services. Gotham Sports will use location services to determine what content users are eligible to view. Gotham Sports is only available in the continental US.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Gotham Sports is the new streaming home for the New York Yankees, the New York Knicks, the Brooklyn Nets, the New York Rangers, the New York Islanders, the New Jersey Devils, the Buffalo Sabres, and more all in one, easy-to-use app. Access to Gotham Sports includes:<br>o Live games and full game replays<br>o Hometown coverage and in-depth analysis<br>o Award-winning original programming and exclusive content<br>o Play-by-play stats and Pick-N-Play predictor game with prizes<br>o Gotham Sports rewards program <br><br>There are two ways fans can get access to Gotham Sports: <br>1. Free with an eligible cable subscription:  <br>if you have access YES Networks and MSG Networks as part of your cable subscription, you\u2019ll have free access to Gotham Sports. Just download the app, create a free account, and link your cable subscription account. <br>2. Subscribe directly to Gotham Sports:  <br>if you don\u2019t have access to an eligible TV subscription, you can subscribe directly in the Gotham Sports app or on https://gothamsports.com/. <br><br>Location restrictions:<br>o Gotham Sports will only stream games that are available on the YES Networks and MSG Network. Local blackout restrictions apply.<br>o League and programming restrictions require Gotham Sports mobile &amp; tablet users to turn on location services. Gotham Sports will use location services to determine what content users are eligible to view. Gotham Sports is only available in the continental US.",
